; L-96's witness, written for this review: one given fact of three arguments with a :source, and a rule that
; derives a second one, so the KB view draws two octagons, one with a source and one with a rule.
(relation gives Person Person Pet :why "{?1} gives {?2} the {?3}")
(gives Ann Bob Rex :source "s1")
(rule pass () :match (gives ?a ?b ?p) :assert (gives ?b ?a ?p) :why "{?b} gives {?p} back to {?a}")
(solve :no-search)
